#: ../../source/templates_resend.md:118
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_resend.md:119
msgid ""
"**Three-font editorial hierarchy**: Domaine Display (serif, hero), ABC "
"Favorit (geometric sans, sections), Inter (readable body). Each font has "
"a strict role — they never cross lanes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_resend.md:120
msgid ""
"**Aggressive negative tracking on display**: Domaine at -0.96px, ABC "
"Favorit at -2.8px. The display type feels compressed, urgent, and "
"designed — like a magazine masthead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_resend.md:121
msgid ""
"**Positive tracking on nav**: ABC Favorit nav links use +0.35px letter-"
"spacing — the only positive tracking in the system. This creates airy, "
"spaced-out navigation text that contrasts with the compressed headings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_resend.md:122
msgid ""
"**OpenType as identity**: The `\"ss01\"`, `\"ss03\"`, `\"ss04\"`, "
"`\"ss11\"` stylistic sets are enabled on all ABC Favorit and Domaine "
"text, activating alternate glyphs that give Resend's typography its "
"unique character."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_resend.md:123
msgid ""
"**Commit Mono as design element**: The monospace font isn't hidden in "
"code blocks — it's used prominently for code examples and technical "
"content, treated as a first-class visual element."
msgstr ""

